In a warmed #mug{}, combine @Irish cream liqueur{3/4%oz}, @Amaretto{1/4%oz}, and @hot strong coffee{5%oz}.

Top with a generous dollop of @whipped cream{} and drizzle with additional @Amaretto{1%tsp}.
